          "short": "E",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+4)^2&=x^2+2(x)(4)+4^2\\\\&=x^2+8x+16\\end{align*}$$The match is E.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 8
